---

<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 520 284" role="img" aria-labelledby="pipeline-diagram-title">
    <title id="pipeline-diagram-title">ZapNLP 分词流水线：词典配方与感知机配方两条路径</title>

    <text class="label" x="8" y="14">SegmentRecipe.standard()</text>

    <rect class="box" x="6" y="24" width="94" height="52" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="53" y="49" text-anchor="middle">输入文本</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="53" y="65" text-anchor="middle">字符串 · char[]</text>

    <rect class="box" x="109.5" y="24" width="94" height="52" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="156.5" y="49" text-anchor="middle">候选铺图</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="156.5" y="65" text-anchor="middle">核心词典 · 规则</text>

    <rect class="box" x="213" y="24" width="94" height="52" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="260" y="49" text-anchor="middle">Viterbi 选路</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="260" y="65" text-anchor="middle">二元语法</text>

    <rect class="box" x="316.5" y="24" width="94" height="52" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="363.5" y="49" text-anchor="middle">人名 · 词性</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="363.5" y="65" text-anchor="middle">可独立开关</text>

    <rect class="box" x="420" y="24" width="94" height="52" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="467" y="49" text-anchor="middle">Token 流</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="467" y="65" text-anchor="middle">流式 · 列表</text>

    <path class="arrow" d="M101.5 45.5 L107.5 50 L101.5 54.5" />
    <path class="arrow" d="M205 45.5 L211 50 L205 54.5" />
    <path class="arrow" d="M308.5 45.5 L314.5 50 L308.5 54.5" />
    <path class="arrow" d="M412 45.5 L418 50 L412 54.5" />

    <rect class="panel" x="6" y="96" width="508" height="100" rx="12" />
    <text class="label" x="18" y="116">SegmentRecipe.perceptron()</text>

    <rect class="box-fill" x="16" y="126" width="110" height="46" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="71" y="145" text-anchor="middle">输入文本</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="71" y="161" text-anchor="middle">字符串 · char[]</text>

    <rect class="box-fill" x="142" y="126" width="110" height="46" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="197" y="145" text-anchor="middle">CWS 边界判定</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="197" y="161" text-anchor="middle">感知机</text>

    <rect class="box-fill" x="268" y="126" width="110" height="46" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="323" y="145" text-anchor="middle">原子补洞</text>

    <rect class="box-fill" x="394" y="126" width="110" height="46" rx="10" />
    <text class="t" x="449" y="145" text-anchor="middle">Token 流</text>
    <text class="t-sm" x="449" y="161" text-anchor="middle">流式 · 列表</text>

    <path class="arrow" d="M127.5 144.5 L133.5 149 L127.5 153.5" />
    <path class="arrow" d="M253.5 144.5 L259.5 149 L253.5 153.5" />
    <path class="arrow" d="M379.5 144.5 L385.5 149 L379.5 153.5" />

    <text class="muted" x="18" y="186">线性路径：不跑二元语法，也不经 Viterbi 选路</text>

    <rect class="chip" x="30" y="212" width="140" height="30" rx="15" />
    <text class="muted" x="100" y="231" text-anchor="middle">用户词典：选路后合并</text>

    <rect class="chip" x="184" y="212" width="140" height="30" rx="15" />
    <text class="muted" x="254" y="231" text-anchor="middle">纠错词典：优先级更高</text>

    <rect class="chip" x="338" y="212" width="152" height="30" rx="15" />
    <text class="muted" x="414" y="231" text-anchor="middle">indexTerms()：附索引子词</text>

    <text class="muted" x="10" y="264">build() 一次，PipelineSegmenter 线程安全，可作单例全局复用</text>
  </svg>
</figure>

<style>
  .diagram {
    margin: 0;
  }

  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--sl-font);
  }

  .box {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .box-fill {
    fill: var(--sl-color-black);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .panel {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 6%, transparent);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
  }

  .chip {
    fill: var(--sl-color-black);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .t {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }

  .t-sm {
    fill: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.72;
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }

  .label {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .muted {
    fill: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.72;
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }
</style>